# Lane B sample assets.
#
# The CC0 room photo sets are committed, together with the manifest that
# records each set's source, headings and licence.
#
# The generated product models and the alternatives catalogues are not.
# They are built from other merchants' product photography and listing
# data, and this repository records no licence covering them.
ethyneon-studio/samples/*
!ethyneon-studio/samples/rooms/
ethyneon-studio/samples/models/
ethyneon-studio/samples/catalog/
